    "enUS": {
      "description": "A small placard on one of the ends of the keg says,\n\n\"Chen Stormstout-\n\nMay your spirit be raised and always raise your spirits.\"",
      "dialogue": {
        "5882504a6ad2db03dc6a": "Yes?",
        "a0496342a2e81725fcaf": "Well, I'll be...$B$BThis was one of Chen Stormstout's kegs. He traveled with Rexxar a long time ago. I haven't seen or heard about him in a kodo's age. I appreciate you bringing this to me, $N."
      },
      "summary": "Find someone who knows about Chen's Empty Keg.",
      "title": "Chen's Empty Keg",
